	      4 bSBTValidTimeMark,  //! <Type Comment="Flag marking if the stored time mark for last automatic SBT is valid. If the time mark is invalid SBT is triggered at next PowerOn() when feature is active." Name="t_s_SafetyData.Flags.bSBTValidTimeMark"/>
